[尖叫……]

04:16.482 --> 04:16.620
[GURGLING]
[淙淙]

04:25.206 --> 04:25.344
[SCREAMING]
[尖叫]

04:30.655 --> 04:30.793
DAY FIVE, I THINK.
第五天，我想。

04:32.896 --> 04:33.000
I'VE BEEN WADDLING THESE FIELDS.
我一直在这些田野里摇摇晃晃地走来走去。

04:35.137 --> 04:35.275
I'M HUNGRY, TIRED, AND LOST.
我又饿又累又迷失。

04:38.482 --> 04:38.620
THE ONLY GOOD THING ABOUT
THIS IS, NO SPONGEBOB.
唯一的好处是
这不是海绵宝宝。

04:42.620 --> 04:42.758
JELLYFISH FIELDS.
水母区。

04:44.241 --> 04:44.379
MM...
毫米...

04:46.379 --> 04:46.517
