我不知道。

04:52.103 --> 04:52.241
LET'S GET A CLOSER LOOK.
让我们仔细看看。

04:53.620 --> 04:53.758
[GRUNTING]
[咕噜声]

04:54.965 --> 04:55.068
HI, STRANGER.
嗨，陌生人。

04:56.103 --> 04:56.241
I AM SPONGEBOB.
我是海绵宝宝。

05:02.965 --> 05:03.068
[GRUNTING]
[咕噜声]

05:04.379 --> 05:04.517
[SCREAMING]
[尖叫]

05:05.758 --> 05:05.896
[GROANING...]
[呻吟...]

05:08.551 --> 05:08.689
WAIT A MINUTE.
等一下。

05:09.827 --> 05:09.965
MAYBE HE'S NOT A MONSTER.
也许他不是怪物。

05:12.000 --> 05:12.103
MAYBE HE'S
AN ENDANGERED SPECIES.
也许他是
濒临灭绝的物种。

05:13.862 --> 05:13.965
[GRUNTING]
[咕噜声]

05:15.034 --> 05:15.172
WE SHOULD HELP HIM.
我们应该帮助他。

05:16.310 --> 05:16.448
[LAUGHING] YEAH, HELP HIM.
[笑]是的，帮助他。

05:18.413 --> 05:18.551
GO AWAY.
离开。

05:19.793 --> 05:19.931
CAN'T YOU TELL NOBODY WANTS YOU?
你难道看不出来没人要你吗？

05:21.068 --> 05:21.206
YOU'RE ENDANGERED.
你有危险了。

05:22.413 --> 05:22.551
NOT LIKE THAT.
不是那样的。

05:24.275 --> 05:27.206
WITH LOTS OF LOVE AND AFFECTION,
WE CAN TAKE CARE OF HIM.
充满爱和感情，
我们可以照顾他。

05:27.206 --> 05:27.344
[GROANING]
[呻吟]

05:29.862 --> 05:29.965
SpongeBob: WELL, SMELLY,
HERE YOU ARE.
海绵宝宝：嗯，臭臭的，
你在这里。

05:31.965 --> 05:32.068
YOUR NEW HOME.
您的新家。

05:33.586 --> 05:33.724
OH, SMELLY,
THIS IS GONNA BE GREAT.
哦，臭臭的，
这会很棒的。

05:35.344 --> 05:35.482
WE'LL BE ONE BIG HAPPY FAMILY.
我们将成为一个幸福的大家庭。

05:37.793 --> 05:37.931
LET ME SHOW YOU AROUND.
让我带您参观一下。

05:39.275 --> 05:39.413
HERE'S YOUR BED, SMELLY.
这是你的床，臭臭的。

05:40.931 --> 05:41.034
[GROANING]
[呻吟]

05:42.172 --> 05:42.310
HERE'S YOUR FOOD BOWL.
这是你的食物碗。

05:43.655 --> 05:43.793
AND SOME KIBBLE.
还有一些粗磨食品。

05:46.310 --> 05:46.448
YOU CAN LIVE HERE
FOREVER AND EVER.
你可以住在这里
永远永远。

05:50.103 --> 05:50.241
[SOBBING]
[抽泣]

05:51.206 --> 05:51.344
OH, LOOK, PAT.
哦，看，帕特。

05:53.206 --> 05:53.344
HE'S CRYING TEARS OF JOY.
他流下了喜悦的泪水。

05:55.482 --> 05:55.620
WELL, SMELLY,
THERE'S ONE MORE FAMILY MEMBER
YOU HAVEN'T MET.
嗯，臭臭的，
还有一位家庭成员
你们还没有见过面。

05:59.551 --> 05:59.689
SMELLY, MEET GARY.
臭味，来认识一下加里。

06:01.275 --> 06:01.413
OH, LOOK AT THAT, SMELLY.
哦，看看那个，臭臭的。

06:03.482 --> 06:03.620
GARY LIKES YOU.
加里喜欢你。

06:05.172 --> 06:05.310
[MEOWING...]
[喵呜……]

06:07.068 --> 06:07.206
GARY, NO.
加里，不。

06:08.931 --> 06:09.034
[MEOWING]
[喵呜]

06:10.724 --> 06:10.862
GARY.
加里。

06:12.068 --> 06:12.206
I DON'T THINK GARY LIKES SMELLY.
我不认为加里喜欢臭味。

06:14.344 --> 06:14.482
YEAH, GARY'S NEVER ATTACKED
ANYONE LIKE THAT,
EXCEPT SQUIDWARD.
是的，加里从未受到攻击
任何像这样的人，
除了章鱼哥。

06:16.517 --> 06:16.655
I GUESS SMELLY CAN'T LIVE HERE.
我猜臭臭不能住在这里。

06:18.655 --> 06:18.793
AH, HE CAN COME LIVE WITH ME.
啊，他可以来和我住在一起。

06:20.931 --> 06:21.034
THAT'S A GREAT IDEA, PATRICK.
这是个好主意，帕特里克。

06:22.620 --> 06:22.758
YOU'VE ALWAYS WANTED A PET.
您一直想要一只宠物。

06:24.103 --> 06:24.241
[GROANING]
[呻吟]

06:27.137 --> 06:27.275
ISN'T THAT CUTE?
那不是很可爱吗？

06:28.827 --> 06:31.034
LOOK HOW EXCITED HE IS
TO GET TO YOUR HOUSE.
看看他多兴奋
去你家。

06:31.034 --> 06:31.172
SpongeBob: BYE, SMELLY.
海绵宝宝：再见，臭臭。

06:32.275 --> 06:32.413
HAVE FUN AT PATRICK'S.
在帕特里克家玩得开心。

06:33.310 --> 06:33.448
[GROANING]
[呻吟]

06:35.551 --> 06:35.689
NO, NO, SMELLY.
不，不，有臭味。

06:37.000 --> 06:37.103
SQUIDWARD DOESN'T LIKE PETS.
章鱼哥不喜欢宠物。

06:39.793 --> 06:39.931
HEY, SMELLY, WANNA PLAY CATCH?
嘿，臭臭，想玩接球游戏吗？

06:42.000 --> 06:42.103
[GROANING]
[呻吟]

06:43.724 --> 06:43.862
DON'T WORRY, YOU'LL GET
THE HANG OF IT.
别担心，你会得到
它的窍门。

06:45.689 --> 06:45.827
[GROANING]
[呻吟]

06:46.758 --> 06:46.896
ALMOST.
几乎。

06:48.000 --> 06:48.103
AGAIN.
再次。

06:49.000 --> 06:49.103
[GROANING]
[呻吟]

06:50.000 --> 06:50.137
SO CLOSE.
如此接近。

06:51.620 --> 06:51.758
YEAH, NOW YOU'RE... [GROANING].
是的，现在你……[呻吟]。

06:53.206 --> 06:53.344
[SCREAMING]
[尖叫]

06:55.000 --> 06:55.137
SMELLY!
臭！

06:56.275 --> 06:56.413
WHAT'S GOTTEN INTO YOU?
你怎么了？

06:58.034 --> 06:58.172
HELLO, ANIMAL CONTROL.
你好，动物控制部门。

06:59.965 --> 07:00.137
THERE'S A WILD ANIMAL
LOOSE IN MY HOUSE.
有一种野生动物
在我的房子里松动。

07:02.275 --> 07:02.413
[VOICE ON PHONE]
[电话声音]

07:03.379 --> 07:03.517
SURE, I'LL HOLD.
当然，我会坚持。

07:04.379 --> 07:04.517
