[呻吟]

07:08.275 --> 07:08.379
SMELLY, COME BACK!
臭臭，回来吧！

07:09.724 --> 07:09.862
SMELLY!
臭！

07:14.034 --> 07:14.172
Man: FREEZE.
男人：别动。

07:17.517 --> 07:17.655
OH, WHAT'S ALL THE COMMOTION.
哦，发生了什么骚动？

07:19.000 --> 07:19.137
[SIRENS WAILING]
[警报声]

07:20.724 --> 07:20.862
Man: YOU ARE SURROUNDED.
男子：你们被包围了。

07:22.034 --> 07:22.172
THERE IS NO WAY OUT.
没有出路。

07:23.551 --> 07:23.689
SMELLY.
臭。

07:24.793 --> 07:24.931
SpongeBob: EXCUSE ME.
海绵宝宝：对不起。

07:25.827 --> 07:25.965
PARDON ME.
对不起。

07:27.344 --> 07:28.413
IF I CAN JUST SCOOCH
THROUGH THERE.
如果我可以滑行
通过那里。

07:28.413 --> 07:28.551
EXCUSE ME.
打扰一下。

07:29.448 --> 07:29.586
PARDON ME.
对不起。

07:30.482 --> 07:30.620
EXCUSE ME.
打扰一下。

07:31.758 --> 07:31.896
YOU LEAVE SMELLY ALONE.
你别管臭臭了。

07:33.413 --> 07:33.551
HE'S JUST A POOR, DUMB,
WILD ANIMAL.
他只是一个又穷又笨的人
野生动物。

07:35.448 --> 07:35.586
WILD ANIMALS DON'T
BELONG HERE, SON.
野生动物不会
属于这里，儿子。

07:37.586 --> 07:37.724
THEY BELONG IN THE ZOO.
他们属于动物园。

07:39.068 --> 07:39.206
GET HIM, BOYS.
抓住他，孩子们。

07:40.931 --> 07:41.034
[GRUNTING]
[咕噜声]

07:49.034 --> 07:49.172
[GROWLING]
[咆哮]

07:50.310 --> 07:50.448
[SCREAMING]
[尖叫]

07:53.172 --> 07:53.310
SMELLY!
臭！

07:57.275 --> 07:57.413
MOMMY, WHAT IS THAT THING?
妈妈，那是什么东西？

07:59.034 --> 07:59.172
I DON'T KNOW,
BUT IT'S HIDEOUS, ISN'T IT?
我不知道，
但这很可怕，不是吗？

08:01.620 --> 08:01.758
[LAUGHTER]
[笑声]

08:06.206 --> 08:06.344
THIS ISN'T GOOD.
这不好。

08:07.482 --> 08:07.620
YOU'RE ABSOLUTELY RIGHT.
你是绝对正确的。

08:09.448 --> 08:09.586
IT NEEDS MUSTARD.
它需要芥末。

08:11.034 --> 08:11.172
NO ONE SHOULD
BE TREATED LIKE THAT.
没有人应该
受到这样的对待。

08:12.689 --> 08:12.827
NOT EVEN SOMEONE
AS UGLY AS SMELLY.
甚至没有人
又丑又臭。

08:15.275 --> 08:15.413
SOMETHING NEEDS TO
BE DONE ABOUT THIS,
AND I KNOW EXACTLY
WHAT THAT THING IS.
需要做点什么
完成这件事，
我确切地知道
那东西是什么。

08:19.310 --> 08:19.448
[WHISPERING]
[耳语]

08:24.172 --> 08:24.310
O.K., PATRICK.
好吧，帕特里克。

08:25.344 --> 08:25.482
REMEMBER THE PLAN?
还记得计划吗？

08:26.344 --> 08:26.482
UH, YEAH.
呃，是的。

08:27.448 --> 08:27.586
THIS ONE, RIGHT?
这个，对吧？

08:28.551 --> 08:28.689
NO, NOT THAT.
不，不是那样。

08:30.931 --> 08:31.034
I'M TALKING ABOUT THE PLAN
TO BREAK SMELLY OUT OF
THIS ANIMAL PRISON.
我正在谈论计划
打破臭味
这个动物监狱。

08:33.586 --> 08:33.724
MM, GOOD PLAN.
MM，好计划。

08:36.241 --> 08:36.379
ALL RIGHT, I'LL GO DOWN FIRST.
好吧，我先下去了。

08:38.034 --> 08:38.172
KEEP A LOOKOUT AND FOLLOW ME.
请留意并跟随我。

08:42.482 --> 08:42.620
YOU'RE MY HERO.
你是我的英雄。

08:44.482 --> 08:44.620
[MOANING]
[呻吟]

08:45.827 --> 08:45.965
HEY, SPONGEBOB.
嘿，海绵宝宝。

08:46.862 --> 08:46.965
HELP!
帮助！

08:48.000 --> 08:48.137
[SCREAMING]
[尖叫]

08:49.275 --> 08:49.413
SHH, WE'LL GET CAUGHT.
嘘，我们会被发现的。

08:51.206 --> 08:51.344
[SCREAMING]
[尖叫]

08:52.482 --> 08:52.620
WHAT, I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
什么，我听不到你说话。

08:54.000 --> 08:54.103
I'M SCREAMING TOO LOUD.
我尖叫太大声了。

08:55.482 --> 08:55.620
[SCREAMING]
[尖叫]

09:03.275 --> 09:03.413
[GRUNTING]
[咕噜声]

09:04.655 --> 09:04.793
FEAR NO LONGER, DEAR SMELLY.
别再害怕了，亲爱的臭臭。

09:06.793 --> 09:06.931
WE ARE HERE TO RESCUE YOU.
我们是来拯救你的。

09:08.586 --> 09:08.724
UNDERSTAND?
理解？

09:10.413 --> 09:10.551
WE ARE TAKING YOU HOME.
我们带你回家。

09:15.034 --> 09:15.172
[GROANING]
[呻吟]

09:16.482 --> 09:16.620
LOOK HOW EXCITED HE IS.
看看他有多兴奋。

09:18.000 --> 09:18.103
FLIP THE SWITCH, PATRICK.
打开开关，帕特里克。

09:24.137 --> 09:24.275
SMELLY, YOU'RE FREE.
臭臭，你自由了。

09:32.379 --> 09:32.517
YOU'RE SURROUNDED.
你被包围了。

09:33.758 --> 09:33.896
THERE'S NO USE TRYING TO RUN.
尝试逃跑是没有用的。

09:35.310 --> 09:35.448
RUN, PATRICK, RUN!
跑，帕特里克，跑！

09:40.758 --> 09:40.896
[SIRENS WAILING]
[警报声]

09:42.965 --> 09:43.068
[ALL MUTTERING]
[全都嘀咕]

09:46.310 --> 09:46.448
FASTER, PATRICK.
快一点，帕特里克。

09:49.103 --> 09:49.241
[ALL MUTTERING]
[全都嘀咕]

09:57.206 --> 09:57.344
I'LL LET SMELLY GO FIRST.
我先让臭臭的去吧。

09:59.310 --> 09:59.448
[GRUNTING]
[咕噜声]

10:03.862 --> 10:03.965
DON'T WORRY, SMELLY.
别担心，有臭味。

10:05.689 --> 10:05.827
YOU'RE SAFE WITH US.
和我们在一起你很安全。

10:10.655 --> 10:10.793
THINK WE LOST 'EM.
认为我们失去了他们。

10:12.586 --> 10:12.724
WELL, WE'RE ALL
ONE BIG HAPPY FAMILY AGAIN.
好吧，我们都是
又一个幸福的大家庭。

10:16.000 --> 10:16.137
LET'S SEE WHERE
THIS DARK SEWER TUNNEL LEADS.
让我们看看哪里
这条黑暗的下水道隧道通向。

10:18.379 --> 10:18.517
TRA-LA-LA, LA-LA-LA-LA,
LA-LA-LA-LA-LA-LA.
特拉-拉-拉，拉-拉-拉-拉，
拉-拉-拉-拉-拉-拉。

10:19.862 --> 10:19.965
[GROANING]
[呻吟]

10:21.344 --> 10:21.482
OH, IT'S ALL RIGHT, SMELLY.
哦，没关系，臭臭的。

10:24.206 --> 10:24.344
SOON WE'LL BE HOME,
AND YOU CAN SLEEP IN
THAT COZY LITTLE PET CARRIER
YOU LOVE SO MUCH.
我们很快就会回家，
你可以睡懒觉
那个舒适的小宠物背带
你太爱了。

10:29.034 --> 10:29.172
[SOBBING]
[抽泣]

10:30.517 --> 10:30.655
HEY, I SEE LIGHT.
嘿，我看到了光。

10:32.344 --> 10:32.482
YOU'RE RIGHT, PATRICK,
THAT MUST BE THE WAY OUT.
你是对的，帕特里克，
这一定是出路。

10:34.827 --> 10:34.965
WHOA, WHERE ARE WE?
哇，我们在哪里？

10:39.620 --> 10:39.758
LET'S GO ASK THOSE GUYS.
我们去问问那些人吧。

10:41.103 --> 10:41.241
UM, EXCUSE US?
嗯，请原谅我们？

10:43.758 --> 10:43.896
[GRUNTING]
[咕噜声]

10:45.000 --> 10:47.517
HEY, THEY LOOK JUST LIKE YOU.
嘿，他们看起来就像你一样。

10:47.517 --> 10:47.655
GO, BE WITH YOUR REAL FAMILY.
去吧，和你真正的家人在一起。

10:49.655 --> 10:49.793
GO AHEAD, SMELLY.
继续吧，臭臭的。

10:51.758 --> 10:51.896
[SCREAMING]
[尖叫]

10:54.689 --> 10:54.827
I KNOW YOU'VE COME
TO THINK OF US AS A FAMILY,
BUT IT'S BETTER THIS WAY.
我知道你来了
将我们视为一家人，
但这样更好。

11:00.620 --> 11:00.758
[GRUNTING...]
[咕噜声...]

11:09.000 --> 11:09.103
I'M GONNA MISS HIM, SPONGEBOB.
我会想念他的，海绵宝宝。

11:10.758 --> 11:10.896
ME TOO, BUDDY.
我也是，伙计。

11:11.724 --> 11:11.862
ME TOO.
我也是。

11:13.482 --> 11:15.620
BUT HE'S WITH HIS OWN KIND NOW,
WHERE HE BELONGS.
但他现在和自己的同类在一起，
他属于哪里。

11:15.620 --> 11:15.758
AND ON THAT NOTE, LET US GO BACK
TO WHERE WE BELONG.
关于这一点，让我们回去吧
我们属于哪里。

11:19.068 --> 11:19.206
[GRUNTING...]
[咕噜声...]

