11:29.586 --> 11:29.724
AH, SALUTATIONS, MY CHILDREN.
啊，致敬，我的孩子们。

11:32.413 --> 11:32.551
ARE YOU READY FOR
YOUR DAILY DOSE OF SMOOTH JAZZ?
你准备好了吗
您每天喜欢听流畅的爵士乐吗？

11:35.827 --> 11:35.965
[GRUNTING AND APPLAUSE]
[咕哝声和掌声]

