12:06.275 --> 12:06.413
COME ON, "STOVEY,"
POP THAT CORN.
来吧，“斯托维”
弹出玉米。

12:11.068 --> 12:11.206
GET READY, GARY.
准备好，加里。

12:12.241 --> 12:12.379
[PANTING]
[气喘吁吁]

12:15.344 --> 12:15.482
INCOMING!
来了！

12:17.379 --> 12:17.517
[MEOWING]
[喵呜]

12:25.206 --> 12:25.344
POPCORN IS SERVED.
爆米花上桌了。

