12:31.137 --> 12:31.275
THAT BRO IS TROUBLE
AT ANY CAR WASH.
那个兄弟很麻烦
在任何洗车场。

12:34.551 --> 12:34.689
Man: WE WILL RETURN
TO BIKINI BOTTOM CAR WASH
AFTER THESE MESSAGES.
男：我们会回来的
前往比基尼底洗车场
在这些消息之后。

12:38.482 --> 12:38.620
ARE YOU BORING?
你很无聊吗？

12:41.000 --> 12:41.103
YES, YES I AM.
是的，是的，我是。

12:43.448 --> 12:43.586
Man: WHEN FRIENDS DESCRIBE YOU,
DO THEY USE WORDS
LIKE "DULL," OR "DRAB?"
男：当朋友描述你时，
他们使用文字吗
喜欢“沉闷”还是“单调”？

12:48.551 --> 12:48.689
HA, HA, HA,
DON'T FORGET "PLATITUDINOUS."
哈，哈，哈，
不要忘记“平庸”。

12:55.793 --> 12:55.931
YES, THAT TOO, CHARLIE.
是的，查理。

12:58.344 --> 12:58.482
BUT WHAT IF I TOLD YOU
THAT YOU COULD CHANGE ALL THAT,
WITH THE MAGIC OF... MAGIC.
但如果我告诉你呢
你可以改变这一切，
带着……魔法的魔力。

13:08.517 --> 13:08.655
[LAUGHING]
[笑]

13:10.103 --> 13:10.241
I LOOK LIKE
SOME KIND OF MAGICIAN.
我看起来像
某种魔术师。

13:12.379 --> 13:12.517
NOW PEOPLE WON'T IGNORE ME.
现在人们不会忽视我了。

13:14.310 --> 13:14.448
LET'S HOPE NOT, CHARLIE.
我们希望不会，查理。

13:17.000 --> 13:17.137
WITH MY MR. MAGIC
MAGICAL MAGIC KIT,
和我的先生。魔法
神奇的魔法套件，

13:20.344 --> 13:20.482
EVEN YOU CAN IMPRESS
AND AMAZE YOUR FRIENDS.
即使你也可以给人留下深刻的印象
并让您的朋友惊叹不已。

13:23.793 --> 13:23.931
I WANT TO IMPRESS
AND AMAZE MY FRIENDS.
我想给人留下深刻印象
让我的朋友们惊叹不已。

13:26.172 --> 13:26.310
Mr. Magic: JUST SEND $19.95
TO ME, MR. MAGIC.
魔术师先生：只需发送 19.95 美元
对我来说，先生。魔法。

13:31.448 --> 13:31.586
[PANTING]
[气喘吁吁]

13:37.000 --> 13:37.137
[GRUNTING...]
[咕噜声...]

13:44.206 --> 13:44.344
Man: FOUR TO SIX WEEKS LATER.
男：四到六周后。

13:48.965 --> 13:49.068
ONE MAGIC KIT, AND ANOTHER ONE
OF THESE YELLOW THINGS.
一套魔术套件，另一套
这些黄色的东西。

14:01.000 --> 14:01.137
HERE IT IS.
这里是。

14:02.379 --> 14:02.517
MR. MAGIC'S MAGICAL MAGIC KIT.
先生。 MAGIC 的神奇魔法套件。

14:06.931 --> 14:07.034
[GASPING]
[喘气]

14:07.931 --> 14:08.034
LOOK AT ALL THIS.
看看这一切。

14:09.758 --> 14:09.896
A BOOK OF SPELLS,
MY VERY OWN WAND OF WHIMSY...
一本咒语书，
我自己的奇思妙想魔杖...

14:13.241 --> 14:13.379
THE BEARD OF RASPUTIN.
拉斯普京的胡子。

14:15.689 --> 14:15.827
AND OF COURSE,
THE ALL-IMPORTANT LICENSE
TO PRACTICE MAGIC.
当然，
最重要的许可证
练习魔法。

14:22.137 --> 14:22.275
[SIGHING]
[叹息]

14:23.172 --> 14:23.310
SQUIDWARD.
章鱼哥。

14:24.896 --> 14:25.000
HE'LL APPRECIATE
MY NEWLY-DELIVERED SKILL.
他会欣赏的
我新掌握的技能。

14:26.965 --> 14:27.068
BRINE SODA,
LOW-FAT SEAWEED CRISPS,
COOL JAZZ...
盐水苏打水，
低脂海藻脆片，
酷爵士乐...

14:33.620 --> 14:33.758
MM-MM-MM, SQUIDWARD,
YOU HAVE DONE IT.
MM-MM-MM，《章鱼哥》，
你已经做到了。

14:36.172 --> 14:36.310
YOU HAVE OFFICIALLY SPOILED
YOURSELF ROTTEN.
你已经正式被宠坏了
你自己烂透了。

14:40.034 --> 14:40.172
Spongebob: WELL, LET
THE ROTTING CONTINUE, FRIEND,
WHILE I IMPRESS AND AMAZE YOU
WITH... MAGIC.
海绵宝宝：好吧，让吧
腐烂还在继续，朋友，
当我给你留下深刻印象和惊奇的时候
带着……魔法。

14:47.620 --> 14:47.758
MAGIC?
魔法？

14:49.241 --> 14:49.344
CAN YOU MAKE YOURSELF
DISAPPEAR, SPONGEBOB?
你能自己做吗
消失吧，海绵宝宝？

14:51.758 --> 14:51.896
[LAUGHING]
[笑]

14:53.000 --> 14:53.137
SILLY SQUIDWARD.
愚蠢的章鱼哥。

14:55.172 --> 14:55.275
I WON'T LEARN VANISHING SPELLS
UNTIL I BECOME
A LEVEL 10 WIZARD.
我不会学习消失咒
直到我成为
10 级巫师。

14:58.241 --> 14:58.379
NO, I'D BETTER START
WITH SOMETHING SIMPLER.
不，我最好开始
用更简单的东西。

15:00.275 --> 15:00.413
SAY, CARD CONJURING.
比如说，纸牌魔术。

15:02.379 --> 15:02.517
HERE, HOLD
THIS SIMPLE PLAYING CARD,
在这里，按住
这张简单的扑克牌，

15:04.758 --> 15:04.896
WHILE I TRANSFORM IT INTO
A MAGIC PLAYING CARD
BEFORE YOUR VERY EYES.
当我把它变成
一张神奇的扑克牌
在您眼前。

15:10.172 --> 15:10.310
LET'S SEE.
让我们来看看。

15:11.172 --> 15:11.310
[SIGHING]
[叹息]

15:12.206 --> 15:12.344
STEP ONE.
第一步。

15:13.241 --> 15:13.379
[EXHALING]
[呼气]

15:14.758 --> 15:14.896
THIS CAN'T POSSIBLY END SOON.
这不可能很快结束。

15:17.551 --> 15:17.689
WHICH BRINGS US TO...
STEP THREE.
这让我们...
第三步。

15:21.275 --> 15:21.413
JUGGLE SOMETHING.
杂耍一些东西。

15:22.689 --> 15:22.827
WELL, IF YOU INSIST, MR. MAGIC.
好吧，如果你坚持的话，先生。魔法。

15:32.758 --> 15:32.896
I DON'T CARE WHERE YOU'RE GOING,
JUST TAKE ME AWAY FROM HERE.
我不在乎你要去哪里
带我离开这里吧。

15:36.379 --> 15:36.517
THEN, TAKE ONE CARD
AND SHOVE IT IN YOUR EAR.
然后，拿一张卡
然后把它塞到你的耳朵里。

15:41.103 --> 15:41.241
[CRYING]
[哭泣]

15:43.517 --> 15:43.655
BUT I DON'T LIKE PISTACHIO.
但我不喜欢开心果。

15:45.965 --> 15:46.068
THEN WHY DID YOU ASK FOR IT?
那你为什么要这么做呢？

15:50.068 --> 15:50.206
[CRYING]
[哭泣]

15:51.448 --> 15:51.586
[GROANING]
[呻吟]

15:53.241 --> 15:58.068
AND FINALLY, JUST SAY
THE WORDS "HOBRIS-POBRIS."
最后，我想说
“HOBRIS-POBRIS”这个词。

15:59.206 --> 15:59.344
SQUIDWARD!
章鱼哥！

16:01.413 --> 16:04.000
MY SIMPLE CARD TRICK
HAS TURNED YOU INTO
AN ICE CREAM CONE.
我的简单纸牌魔术
把你变成了
蛋卷冰淇淋。

16:04.000 --> 16:04.103
WHICH MEANS...
这意味着...

16:05.241 --> 16:05.379
I AM A LEVEL 10 WIZARD!
我是 10 级巫师！

16:07.448 --> 16:07.586
I SUPPOSE I SHOULD CHANGE YOU
BACK TO SQUID FORM.
我想我应该改变你
回到鱿鱼形态。

16:11.448 --> 16:11.586
PRESTO!
急！

16:13.482 --> 16:13.620
UH, LET'S SEE.
呃，让我们看看。

16:15.379 --> 16:15.517
AH, A-HA.
啊，啊哈。

16:16.482 --> 16:16.620
A-LA-KAZAM!
啊-拉-卡赞！

16:18.620 --> 16:18.758
[GASPING]
[喘气]

16:21.344 --> 16:21.482
ABRACADABRA!
胡言乱语！

16:23.413 --> 16:23.551
[GASPING]
[喘气]

16:24.517 --> 16:24.655
OOGLY-DOOGLY.
哎呀——哎呀。

16:26.620 --> 16:26.758
HOBRA-COBRA.
霍布拉-眼镜蛇。

16:27.793 --> 16:27.931
[GASPING]
[喘气]

16:28.862 --> 16:28.965
OPEN SESAME?
芝麻开门？

16:30.758 --> 16:30.896
UH, CHANGE-OH BACK-OH
TO SQUIDWARD-OH, PLEASE-OH.
呃，把-OH 改回-OH
致《章鱼哥》——哦，请——哦。

16:33.862 --> 16:33.965
OH, I AM SO SORRY, SQUIDWARD.
哦，我很抱歉，章鱼哥。

16:37.551 --> 16:37.689
I'VE TRANSFORMED YOU INTO
A DELICIOUS DAIRY DESSERT,
AND I CAN'T CHANGE YOU BACK.
我把你变成了
美味的乳制品甜点，
我无法让你变回来。

16:44.620 --> 16:44.758
THERE, THERE, SQUIDWARD.
那里，那里，章鱼哥。

16:46.206 --> 16:46.344
THERE IS NO NEED TO CRY.
没有必要哭。

16:48.172 --> 16:48.310
I PROMISE YOU WILL CONTINUE
YOUR NORMAL LIFE,
我保证你会继续
您的正常生活，

16:51.000 --> 16:51.103
DESPITE THE FACT
THAT YOU ARE NOW EDIBLE.
尽管事实如此
你现在可以吃了。

