[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]

17:10.793 --> 17:10.931
[SCREAMING]
[尖叫]

17:17.310 --> 17:17.448
[SCREAMING]
[尖叫]

17:19.103 --> 17:19.241
SQUIDWARD, SPEAK TO ME.
章鱼哥，跟我说话。

17:21.310 --> 17:21.448
SPEAK...
说话...

17:24.862 --> 17:24.965
[GRUNTING]
[咕噜声]

17:27.482 --> 17:27.620
[PANTING]
[气喘吁吁]

17:33.862 --> 17:33.965
HEY, SQUID.
嘿，鱿鱼。

17:34.965 --> 17:35.068
ARE YOU O.K.?
你还好吗？

17:37.206 --> 17:37.344
HEY, SQUID.
嘿，鱿鱼。

17:38.413 --> 17:38.551
ARE YOU STILL O.K.?
你还好吗？

17:40.896 --> 17:41.000
[SCREAMING]
[尖叫]

17:41.931 --> 17:42.034
[LAUGHING]
[笑]

17:43.793 --> 17:43.931
HEY, SQUIDWARD.
嘿，章鱼哥。

17:45.000 --> 17:45.137
I GOT SOMETHING FOR YOU.
我有东西给你。

17:46.965 --> 17:47.068
SOMEONE TO KEEP YOU COMPANY
IN THAT DRAB OLD FREEZER.
有人陪伴您
在那个单调的旧冰箱里。

17:50.000 --> 17:50.103
OH, AREN'T THEY CUTE?
哦，他们不是很可爱吗？

17:54.000 --> 17:54.103
I PROMISE TO STAND BY
AS AN ETERNAL GUARD
OVER MY BUDDY.
我保证随时待命
作为永恒的守卫
在我的好友之上。

17:58.034 --> 17:58.172
HEY, SPONGEBOB.
嘿，海绵宝宝。

17:59.137 --> 17:59.275
WHAT YOU DOING?
你在做什么？

18:01.000 --> 18:02.827
I HAVE TURNED POOR SQUIDWARD
INTO A FROZEN DESSERT.
我变成了可怜的章鱼哥
变成冷冻甜点。

18:02.827 --> 18:02.965
THAT'S AWFUL.
太糟糕了。

18:04.517 --> 18:04.655
HOW TRAGIC.
多么悲惨啊。

18:06.620 --> 18:06.758
POOR SQUIDWARD.
可怜的章鱼哥。

18:07.793 --> 18:07.931
IT'S ALL MY FAULT.
都是我的错。

18:09.310 --> 18:09.448
DID YOU SAY FROZEN DESSERT?
你说的是冷冻甜点吗？

18:11.620 --> 18:11.758
YEAH, I TURNED HIM INTO
A TASTY SOFT SERVE
WITH A WAFFLE CONE.
是的，我把他变成了
美味的软服务
配华夫饼蛋筒。

18:15.241 --> 18:15.379
[SOBBING]
[抽泣]

18:16.344 --> 18:16.482
OOH, SOFT SERVE.
哦，软服务。

18:19.068 --> 18:19.206
PATRICK!
帕特里克！

18:20.275 --> 18:20.413
STOP EATING SQUIDWARD!
别再吃章鱼哥了！

18:21.482 --> 18:21.620
OH.
哦。

18:23.034 --> 18:23.172
SORRY.
对不起。

18:24.896 --> 18:25.000
PATRICK!
帕特里克！

18:27.586 --> 18:27.724
[SCREAMING]
[尖叫]

18:28.655 --> 18:30.586
BUT HE'S SO TASTY.
但他太美味了。

18:30.586 --> 18:30.724
[SCREAMING]
[尖叫]

18:32.586 --> 18:32.724
LOOK, PATRICK,
DON'T YOU UNDERSTAND?
看，帕特里克，
你不明白吗？

18:35.000 --> 18:35.137
THIS ISN'T JUST
YOUR ORDINARY ICE CREAM CONE.
这不仅仅是
您的普通蛋卷冰淇淋。

18:37.241 --> 18:37.379
IT'S PISTACHIO.
这是开心果。

18:38.413 --> 18:38.551
NO, IT'S SQUIDWARD.
不，这是章鱼哥。

18:40.931 --> 18:41.034
AND NO MATTER WHAT HAPPENS,
I PROMISED HIM THAT
I WOULD WATCH OVER HIM,
无论发生什么，
我向他保证过
我会守护他，

18:44.965 --> 18:45.068
TO ENSURE HIS SOFT FROZEN LIFE
IS UNCHANGED.
确保他的软冻寿命
不变。

18:50.931 --> 18:51.034
[SCREAMING]
[尖叫]

18:52.344 --> 18:52.482
PATRICK!
帕特里克！

18:53.551 --> 18:53.689
SQUIDWARD HAS MELTED!
章鱼哥融化了！

18:54.655 --> 18:54.793
QUICK, CALL THE POLICE.
快点，报警。

18:56.275 --> 18:56.413
WHAT AM I GONNA DO?
我要做什么？

18:57.931 --> 18:58.034
OH, NEPTUNE,
IT'S ALL MY FAULT.
哦，海王星，
都是我的错。

19:00.517 --> 19:00.655
WHAT HAVE I DONE?
我做了什么？

19:02.793 --> 19:02.931
WHAT HAVE I DONE?
我做了什么？

19:04.000 --> 19:04.103
[SCREAMING]
[尖叫]

19:05.034 --> 19:05.896
WHAT HAVE I DONE?
我做了什么？

19:05.896 --> 19:06.000
[SCREAMING]
[尖叫]

19:06.931 --> 19:07.793
WHAT HAVE I DONE?
我做了什么？

19:07.793 --> 19:07.931
[SCREAMING]
[尖叫]

19:08.827 --> 19:08.965
IT'S ALL YOUR FAULT.
都是你的错。

19:10.793 --> 19:10.931
CURSE YOU,
MR. MAGIC MAGICAL MAGIC KIT.
诅咒你，
先生。魔法魔法魔法套件。

19:13.758 --> 19:13.896
CURSE YOU!
诅咒你！

19:14.655 --> 19:14.793
HEY!
嘿！

19:15.655 --> 19:15.793
THAT'S IT.
就是这样。

19:17.241 --> 19:17.379
THERE'S THE ANSWER
TO OUR PROBLEMS.
答案就在这里
针对我们的问题。

19:18.655 --> 19:18.793
"WARNING.
“警告。

19:19.896 --> 19:20.000
FROM AGES NINE TO 99."
从 9 岁到 99 岁。”

19:21.931 --> 19:22.034
NO, PATRICK.
不，帕特里克。

19:23.482 --> 19:25.000
THE ONE MYSTIC BEING
THAT CAN HELP US.
独一的神秘存在
这可以帮助我们。

19:25.000 --> 19:25.103
MR. MAGIC.
先生。魔法。

19:27.448 --> 19:27.586
JUST FOLLOW THE BROWN TILE ROAD
TO THE MOST MYSTERIOUS MYSTIC
OF 'EM ALL.
沿着棕色瓷砖路走即可
致最神秘的神秘主义者
他们所有人。

19:31.000 --> 19:31.103
NO ONE'S EVER SEEN HIM
IN PERSON.
没有人见过他
亲自。

19:33.379 --> 19:33.517
Mr. Magic: ENTER.
魔术师：请输入。

19:34.448 --> 19:34.586
[STAMMERING]
[结巴]

19:41.862 --> 19:41.965
WHO DARES TO SEE MR. MAGIC?
谁敢见先生？魔法？

19:45.000 --> 19:45.103
[SCREAMING]
[尖叫]

19:46.310 --> 19:46.448
SPEAK UP.
大声说出来。

19:48.448 --> 19:52.724
IT IS I,
SPONGEBOB OF THE SQUAREPANTS,
MAGICIAN LEVEL ONE.
这是我，
海绵宝宝的方块人，
一级魔术师。

19:52.724 --> 19:52.862
AND I HAVE CHANGED MY FRIEND
INTO ICE CREAM.
我已经改变了我的朋友
进入冰淇淋。

19:56.068 --> 19:56.206
GOOD JOB.
好工作。

19:57.931 --> 19:58.034
WELL, THANK YOU, BUT...
WELL, I CAN'T CHANGE HIM BACK.
嗯，谢谢你，但是……
好吧，我无法改变他。

20:00.586 --> 20:00.724
HMM, UM, WELL, HAVE YOU EVER
THOUGHT OF A DIFFERENT HOBBY?
嗯，嗯，嗯，你有过吗
想有不同的爱好吗？

20:04.586 --> 20:04.724
I NEED YOUR HELP
TO CHANGE HIM BACK.
我需要你的帮助
让他变回来。

20:07.275 --> 20:07.413
MY HELP?
我的帮助？

20:08.448 --> 20:08.586
UH, NO THANK YOU.
呃，不，谢谢。

20:10.379 --> 20:10.517
BUT IF YOU DON'T,
MY FRIEND WILL BE
A CONE FOREVER.
但如果你不这样做，
我的朋友将会是
永远的锥体。

20:12.724 --> 20:12.862
SORRY, I, UM, I'M,
OUT TO LUNCH, THAT'S IT.
抱歉，我，嗯，我，
出去吃午饭，就是这样。

20:15.896 --> 20:16.000
I'LL WAIT.
我会等待。

20:17.103 --> 20:17.241
I'M ON A TWO-YEAR LUNCH.
我正在吃两年的午餐。

20:18.310 --> 20:18.448
OH, PLEASE.
哦，拜托。

20:19.620 --> 20:19.758
Mr. Magic: SILENCE.
魔术先生：安静。

20:21.413 --> 20:21.551
BUT SIR, NO ONE ELSE
HAS YOUR POWER OF SORCERY.
但是先生，没有其他人
有你的巫术力量。

20:24.689 --> 20:24.827
THANK YOU.
谢谢。

20:27.000 --> 20:30.689
HEY, SPONGEBOB,
THERE'S A GUY OVER HERE
TALKING INTO A TUBEY THING.
嘿，海绵宝宝，
这里有一个人
对着管子说话。

20:30.689 --> 20:30.827
UM, IGNORE YOUR FRIEND.
嗯，忽略你的朋友。

20:32.793 --> 20:32.931
THE FISH YOU SEE
IS ONLY AN ILLUSION.
你看到的鱼
只是一个幻觉。

20:35.655 --> 20:35.793
HUH?
嗯？

20:37.620 --> 20:39.793
WHY'S HE SAYING
THE SAME THING
MR. MAGIC'S SAYING?
他为什么这么说
同样的事情
先生。魔术师怎么说？

20:39.793 --> 20:39.931
I DON'T KNOW, PATRICK.
我不知道，帕特里克。

20:41.172 --> 20:41.310
WHO ARE YOU, GOOD SIR?
好先生，您是谁？

20:43.206 --> 20:43.344
WELL, UH, UH,
I'M HORACE B. MAGIC.
嗯，呃，呃，
我是霍勒斯·B·魔术师。

20:47.206 --> 20:47.344
ARE YOU MR. MAGIC?
您是先生吗？魔法？

20:49.689 --> 20:49.827
[LAUGHING]
[笑]

20:50.965 --> 20:51.068
TECHNICALLY, YES.
从技术上来说，是的。

20:53.034 --> 20:53.172
BUT THE ONLY MAGIC AROUND HERE
IS THE MAGIC OF BUSINESS.
但这里唯一的魔力
这是商业的魔力。

20:56.344 --> 20:56.482
DOES THAT MEAN YOU CAN'T
CHANGE MY FRIEND BACK?
这是否意味着你不能
把我的朋友改回来？

20:59.275 --> 20:59.413
OH, I'M AFRAID NOT.
哦，恐怕不是。

21:02.275 --> 21:02.413
SO SORRY ABOUT THAT, LADDIE.
非常抱歉，莱迪。

21:03.965 --> 21:04.068
YOUR REFUND CHECK
IS IN THE MAIL.
您的退款支票
已在邮件中。

21:05.896 --> 21:06.000
I DON'T NEED A REFUND.
我不需要退款。

21:07.379 --> 21:07.517
I WANT MY FRIEND BACK.
我想要我的朋友回来。

21:08.896 --> 21:09.000
THIS ISN'T ABOUT MONEY.
这与金钱无关。

21:10.551 --> 21:10.689
YOU'RE NOTHING BUT A FAKE.
你只不过是个冒牌货。

21:12.172 --> 21:12.310
JUST A LYING,
CORPORATE BUSINESSMAN,
只是一个谎言，
企业商人，

21:14.758 --> 21:14.896
TAINTING THE PURITY OF MAGIC
WITH YOUR CORRUPT,
COMMERCIAL WAYS.
玷污魔法的纯粹性
随着你的腐败，
商业方式。

21:18.862 --> 21:18.965
YOU HAVE RUINED MY FAITH
IN THE MAGICAL ARTS.
你毁了我的信仰
在魔法艺术中。

21:22.310 --> 21:22.448
[SOBBING]
[抽泣]

21:26.413 --> 21:26.551
SECURITY.
安全。

21:29.000 --> 21:29.137
[SOBBING]
[抽泣]

21:31.827 --> 21:31.965
WHAT ARE WE GONNA
DO ABOUT SQUIDWARD?
我们要做什么
关于《章鱼哥》吗？

21:33.758 --> 21:33.896
WE COULD ALWAYS EAT HIM.
我们总是可以吃掉他。

21:36.034 --> 21:36.172
I'M KIND OF HUNGRY.
我有点饿了。

21:37.655 --> 21:37.793
MR. MAGIC WAS A FAKE.
先生。魔法是假的。

21:39.379 --> 21:39.517
AND ALL OF HIS MAGIC STUFF
IS FAKE.
以及他所有的魔法
是假的。

21:41.793 --> 21:41.931
ALL THOSE MAGIC WORDS,
THEY WERE FAKE.
所有这些神奇的词语，
