21:58.551 --> 21:58.689
SQUIDWARD, YOU'RE BACK.
章鱼哥，你回来了。

22:01.034 --> 22:01.172
THE MAGIC WORDS WORKED.
神奇的话语起了作用。

22:03.241 --> 22:03.379
I REALLY AM MAGIC AFTER ALL.
毕竟我真的很神奇。

