[抱怨]

22:15.241 --> 22:15.379
HEY, SPONGEBOB?
嘿，海绵宝宝？

22:16.413 --> 22:16.551
I'M STILL HUNGRY.
我还饿。

22:18.586 --> 22:21.275
WILL YOU TURN ME INTO
A JAR OF MAYONNAISE
SO I CAN EAT MYSELF?
你会把我变成
一罐蛋黄酱
所以我可以自己吃饭吗？

22:21.275 --> 22:21.413
